  10:Src/power/drivers/power_i2c_bus/power_i2c_bus.c ****  * Cube timing for a 120 MHz I2C123 kernel clock, Standard-mode (100 kHz),
  11:Src/power/drivers/power_i2c_bus/power_i2c_bus.c ****  * analog filter enabled and digital filter disabled.
  12:Src/power/drivers/power_i2c_bus/power_i2c_bus.c ****  *
  13:Src/power/drivers/power_i2c_bus/power_i2c_bus.c ****  * I2C1 is sourced from D2PCLK1 below.  The board clock configuration keeps
  14:Src/power/drivers/power_i2c_bus/power_i2c_bus.c ****  * D2PCLK1 at 120 MHz for both the boot and application clock plans.
